'' RUN: iif's result type over every pair of the ten numeric builtins (audit F-62): a float
'' wins (DOUBLE over SINGLE), two integers give the LARGER with no promotion and the
'' unsigned one on a tie -- tiko made every one INTEGER. Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/iif-type-matrix.bas -o tests/codegen/iiftypematrix.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/iiftypematrix.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: byte byte 1-1-1
